[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14580.87, "timestamp": "04:03:00", "text": "好的，我可以修改一下这个想法。我可以做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14584.55, "timestamp": "04:03:04", "text": "就像达成共识一样。简单的。所以就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14587.75, "timestamp": "04:03:07", "text": "没有征得同意，更像是“是的，我做了”。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14589.506, "timestamp": "04:03:09", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "great stuff truly"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14590.95, "timestamp": "04:03:10", "text": "把所有东西都保存下来。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14593.91, "timestamp": "04:03:13", "text": "那就对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14596.229, "timestamp": "04:03:16", "text": "我还编写了更多条件语句。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14598.389, "timestamp": "04:03:18", "text": "我当时是醒着的，还是睡着的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14601.59, "timestamp": "04:03:21", "text": "就像睡着的溪流一样，嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14604.469, "timestamp": "04:03:24", "text": "关掉设备，但打开电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14607.189, "timestamp": "04:03:27", "text": "在这一特定时间启动所有程序"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14609.99, "timestamp": "04:03:29", "text": "使用 OBS 等软件开始直播。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14613.75, "timestamp": "04:03:33", "text": "不知道是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14615.83, "timestamp": "04:03:35", "text": "只有当你注意到“哦，为什么”的时候，你才会明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14617.83, "timestamp": "04:03:37", "text": "我的直播是不是被切断了？为什么是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14617.848, "timestamp": "04:03:37", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "my g making stuff automatic"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14620.15, "timestamp": "04:03:40", "text": "这条溪流好像分为三部分？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14622.309, "timestamp": "04:03:42", "text": "那时你不会想，“哦，糟糕。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14625.269, "timestamp": "04:03:45", "text": "有人淘气了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14628.79, "timestamp": "04:03:48", "text": "是的。所以，我做了很多高质量的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14631.03, "timestamp": "04:03:51", "text": "生活琐事。所以即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14635.189, "timestamp": "04:03:55", "text": "这些关于Joathon的事，嗯，我也做了很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14637.11, "timestamp": "04:03:57", "text": "自动化，这样即使我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14639.83, "timestamp": "04:03:59", "text": "在户外，我可以用手机控制电脑。"}]